      "message": "[warning] Line 31: 🟡 `isEmojiOnly` is now cached and only refreshed when `message` is reassigned (`didSet`). If `MessageModel` is a reference type that gets mutated in place (e.g., message edits/updates), this value can become stale and the spacing logic in `MessageStackView` will desync from actual content. Prefer a computed property (`var isEmojiOnly: Bool { message.isEmojiOnly() }`) or refresh `isEmojiOnly` from the same callback/path that updates mutable message content.",
